# ROUTER ENGINE: INTENT CLASSIFICATION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Takes raw user input and returns a tuple: (kind, text, topic)
#
# * IMPORTANT: The caller must unpack as: kind, _, topic = classify(text)
#   (Not: kind, topic, _ = ...) — this was V5 Bug #1.
